#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:88
#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStreamIntegration.php:78
msgid ""
"If you don't have a BunnyCDN account yet, visit the BunnyCDN website and "
"create a new account."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du noch kein BunnyCDN-Konto hast, lege auf der BunnyCDN-Website eins "
"an."

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:92
#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStreamIntegration.php:82
msgid "Visit BunnyCDN"
msgstr "Zu BunnyCDN"

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:96
msgid "Step 2: Create Storage Zone"
msgstr "Schritt 2: Storage-Zone anlegen"

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:97
msgid ""
"In your BunnyCDN dashboard, navigate to Storage and create a new Storage "
"Zone. This will be used to store your video files."
msgstr ""
"Gehe im BunnyCDN-Dashboard auf Storage und lege eine neue Storage-Zone an. "
"Dort liegen später Deine Videodateien."

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:99
msgid "Choose a region closest to your audience for better performance."
msgstr "Wähle die Region, die Deinem Publikum am nächsten liegt."

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:102
msgid "Step 3: Get Storage Credentials"
msgstr "Schritt 3: Zugangsdaten holen"

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:103
msgid ""
"After creating the storage zone, you'll get the FTP/Storage credentials "
"including username and password."
msgstr ""
"Nach dem Anlegen der Storage-Zone bekommst Du die FTP- beziehungsweise "
"Storage-Zugangsdaten mit Benutzername und Passwort."

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:105
msgid "These credentials are different from your account login credentials."
msgstr "Diese Zugangsdaten sind nicht Deine Konto-Anmeldedaten."

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:108
msgid "Step 4: Note the Hostname"
msgstr "Schritt 4: Hostname notieren"

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:109
msgid ""
"The storage hostname is typically \"storage.bunnycdn.com\" but may vary "
"based on your region."
msgstr ""
"Der Storage-Hostname lautet meist „storage.bunnycdn.com“, kann je nach "
"Region aber abweichen."

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:111
msgid ""
"If you're using a custom pull zone, you'll need to use that hostname "
"instead."
msgstr "Bei einer eigenen Pull-Zone nimmst Du stattdessen deren Hostname."

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:114
#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStreamIntegration.php:108
msgid "Step 5: Configure Integration"
msgstr "Schritt 5: Integration einrichten"

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:115
msgid ""
"Enter your storage username, hostname, and password in the fields below and "
"enable the integration."
msgstr ""
"Trage Benutzername, Hostname und Passwort unten ein und schalte die "
"Integration ein."

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:119
#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStreamIntegration.php:113
msgid "Step 6: Secure Your Videos (Optional)"
msgstr "Schritt 6: Videos absichern (optional)"

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:120
msgid ""
"To protect your videos with signed URLs, enable Token Authentication on your"
" Storage Pull Zone and enter the security key below."
msgstr ""
"Um Deine Videos mit signierten URLs zu schützen, schalte in der Storage-"
"Pull-Zone die Token-Authentifizierung ein und trage den Sicherheitsschlüssel"
" unten ein."

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:122
msgid ""
"Go to CDN → Pull Zones → Your Pull Zone → Security → Enable \"Token "
"Authentication\" → Copy the Token Authentication Key and paste it in the "
"\"CDN Security Key\" field below."
msgstr ""
"Gehe zu CDN → Pull Zones → Deine Pull-Zone → Security → „Token "
"Authentication“ einschalten → den Token-Authentication-Key kopieren und "
"unten in „CDN-Sicherheitsschlüssel“ einfügen."

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:125
msgid "Step 7: Test Connection"
msgstr "Schritt 7: Verbindung testen"

#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStorageIntegration.php:126
#: app/Integrations/BunnyCDNStreamIntegration.php:126
msgid ""
"After saving your settings, use the \"Test Connection\" button to verify "
"that the integration is working correctly."
msgstr ""
"Nach dem Speichern prüfst Du mit „Verbindung testen“, ob die Integration "
"läuft."

